<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quaker rating said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quaker rating said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette on Monday cut its rating on Quaker Oats Co to underperform from market perform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Quaker shares were down 7/8 at 38-1/2.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
